{"ordinal":10278,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454388785161","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_5_0068548","source":"Esenin: Это какой-то пиздец. Меня всё пугает до усрачки.","target":"Esenin: E un rahat de nedescris. Mă sperie totul de mă cac pe mine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-262.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
