{"ordinal":10286,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454388785153","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_4_3_08930ee","source":"Esenin: Я… я хочу побыть один.","target":"Esenin: Eu… eu vreau să fiu singur.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-262.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10287,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454388785152","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_4_3_0feff4e","source":"Esenin: Пустое пространство бесконечного мрака. Если после смерти мы попадаем туда, это всё равно что исчезнуть…","target":"Esenin: Spațiul gol al întunericului nesfârșit. Dacă acolo ajungem după moarte, e ca și cum am dispărea…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-262.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10288,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454384590859","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_4_3_093c5c5","source":"Esenin: Наверно, если бы было что-то, мы бы уже вышли на какой-то сигнал или ещё что-то. Не знаю.","target":"Esenin: Probabil că, dacă ar mai exista ceva, am fi găsit deja vreun semnal sau ceva. Nu știu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-262.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10289,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454384590858","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_4_3_01db6ed","source":"Esenin: Нет никакой другой жизни. Пустой холодный космос.","target":"Esenin: Nu există altă viață. Doar cosmosul gol și rece.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-262.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10290,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454384590857","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_4_3_0cf54e5","source":"Esenin: В космосе-то кроме нас ничего нет.","target":"Esenin: În cosmos nu există nimic în afară de noi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-262.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10291,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454384590856","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_4_3_05de24b","source":"Esenin: А так если подумать…","target":"Esenin: Oricum, dacă stai să te gândești…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-262.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10292,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454384590855","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_4_2_055da2d","source":"Esenin: Мне что-то сейчас не хочется разговаривать.","target":"Esenin: Nu prea am chef să vorbesc acum.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-262.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10293,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454384590854","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_4_2_0259bc2","source":"Esenin: Вообще ничего не будет… Просто… темнота?","target":"Esenin: Nu va mai fi nimic… Doar… întuneric?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-262.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10294,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454384590853","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_4_2_06bd2b1","source":"Esenin: Ты, конечно, может, и прав. Но это настолько жутко.","target":"Esenin: Poate că ai dreptate. Dar e atât de îngrozitor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-262.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
