{"ordinal":10315,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454376202249","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_2_07aca0f","source":"Esenin: Однажды так нас тряхнёт, жди беды.","target":"Esenin: Într-o zi ne va zgudui atât de tare, că va fi vai de noi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10316,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454376202248","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_2_05a0c00","source":"Esenin: Пытается Земля нас стряхнуть, как зажравшихся блох.","target":"Esenin: Pământul încearcă să ne scuture de pe el ca pe niște purici prea îmbuibați.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10317,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454376202247","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_2_066af21","source":"Esenin: Куда ни глянь, снова кто-то кого-то убил. Или ледники тают. Или леса горят. Лихорадка у этого мира.","target":"Esenin: Oriunde te uiți, cineva a ucis iar pe cineva. Sau se topesc ghețarii. Sau ard pădurile. Lumea asta are febră.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10318,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454376202246","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_2_0ab4a49","source":"Esenin: Да не у меня жар, а у всей ебучей планеты.","target":"Esenin: Nu eu am febră, ci toată planeta asta nenorocită.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10319,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454376202245","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_1_0ae9e8d","source":"Esenin: Уйди, тошно мне.","target":"Esenin: Pleacă, mi-e greață.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10320,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454376202244","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_1_0ffffd0","source":"Esenin: Блять.","target":"Esenin: Futu-i.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10321,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454376202243","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_1_0fcd0e2","source":"Esenin: Как будто мы ну никак не можем жить без обосранных штанов.","target":"Esenin: De parcă n-am putea trăi fără să ne căcăm pe noi.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10322,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454376202242","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_1_01df6c6","source":"Esenin: Если, сука, проблем нет, обязательно надо создать их себе.","target":"Esenin: Dacă n-avem probleme, fir-ar să fie, trebuie neapărat să ni le facem singuri.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10323,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454376202241","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_1_02f6fe9","source":"Esenin: Не добьёт солнце – значит, это сделают Гости. Гостей одолеем – сами себя живьём похороним.","target":"Esenin: Dacă nu ne termină Soarele, ne termină Musafirii. Dacă îi învingem pe Musafiri, ne vom îngropa singuri de vii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10324,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454376202240","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_1_00341c6","source":"Esenin: Знаешь, мне кажется, скоро мы все просто умрём.","target":"Esenin: Știi, mi se pare că în curând vom muri cu toții.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10325,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454372007947","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_1_02b0ac7","source":"Esenin: Все говорят, что решают проблемы, а на деле не происходит вообще нихера.","target":"Esenin: Toți spun că rezolvă probleme, dar de fapt nu se întâmplă absolut nimic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
