{"ordinal":10328,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454372007944","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_1_00f6df0","source":"Esenin: Тошно мне, домовладелец. Решил немного выпить, что же тут криминального?","target":"Esenin: Mi-e greață, proprietarule. Am hotărât să beau puțin. Ce-i așa criminal în asta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10329,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454372007943","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_3_1_03f3389","source":"Esenin: Ну… выпил я пива у тебя немного.","target":"Esenin: Păi… am băut puțin din berea ta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
