{"ordinal":10335,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454372007937","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_esenin_3_0302dfc","source":"Esenin: Да? Ты что-то хотел?","target":"Esenin: Da? Voiai ceva?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10336,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454372007936","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_2_0229492","source":"Esenin: Я так однажды достану до люстры и над всем миром крещёным повисну.","target":"Esenin: Într-o zi o să ajung la candelabru și o să atârn deasupra întregii lumi creștine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10337,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454367813643","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_2_0c61701","source":"Esenin: И без всего этого тоскливо жилось, а тут ещё…","target":"Esenin: Și fără toate astea viața era tristă, iar acum mai vine și…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10338,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454367813642","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_2_0c6ead8","source":"Esenin: Нет, всё, домовладелец, итак нервы ни к чёрту.","target":"Esenin: Nu, gata, proprietarule, nervii mei sunt deja la pământ.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10339,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454367813641","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_2_0819f85","source":"Esenin: А потом спрашиваю себя: а оно мне надо?","target":"Esenin: Iar apoi mă întreb: chiar am nevoie de asta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10340,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454367813640","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_2_0478fea","source":"Esenin: Но послушаешь телевизор или какие разговоры, и снова аж свербит всё внутри.","target":"Esenin: Dar de îndată ce ascult televizorul sau discuțiile altora, iar mă roade ceva pe dinăuntru.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10341,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454367813639","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Esenin_Asking_2_08930be","source":"Esenin: Я не лезу уже ни к кому. Себе дороже.","target":"Esenin: Nu mă mai bag peste nimeni. Îmi fac singur rău.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-263.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":10342,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504454367813638","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:talk_esenin_2_0fbd031","source":"Мне надо тебя проверить","target":"Trebuie să te verific","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
